### get userinfo with auth_token
# @no-redirect
GET {{ WLS_AUTH_SERVICE }}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}

### Generate Wahllokalbenutzer (needs profile 'dummy.clients' to make this work because of internal calls to other services) | user wls_all_uwb
POST {{ WLS_ADMIN_SERVICE_URL }}/businessActions/generateWahllokalbenutzer/4526485e-2a3f-43d6-bd57-d0a58fc330cb
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("auth-service")}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Export Wahllokalbenutzer (needs profile 'dummy.clients' to make this work because of internal calls to other services) | user wls_all_uwb
